--- a function is no value to compare: refused before the program runs —
--- interpreted it had compared by name, compiled by address or not built
--- at all, so `same[one, one]` was false in one mode and true in the
--- other (Rosetta Code, Stair-climbing puzzle)

fn one[]
    return 1

fn same[a, b]
    return a eq b

log[same[one, one]]
